  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The arithmetic mean of a set of \\(50\\) numbers is \\(38.\\) If two numbers of the set, namely \\(45\\) and \\(55,\\) are discarded, the arithmetic mean of the remaining set of numbers is:",
